{"entry_index":40,"uid":"zhcn:401d737676a702665ce907c8","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"总之就提起干劲来做吧——","source_fingerprint":"36d1d79bd80b86635485f7009a93a2efd115b99cdc3335b04495b39f82f36996","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1020","20005"],"target_text":"Tóm lại cứ lấy tinh thần lên rồi làm thôi——","reviewed":true},
{"entry_index":41,"uid":"zhcn:047bc1c850fcae784ad816ba","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"你好——\r\n今天我们要做什么呢——？","source_fingerprint":"d75adef75c451c08395ec58851beea38fd6c95aa94c28b06a5eb761d62b978fd","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1020","20006"],"target_text":"Xin chào——\r\nHôm nay chúng ta làm gì đây——?","reviewed":true},
{"entry_index":42,"uid":"zhcn:274df7646eadc61bd0e0fb00","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"唔唔唔，训练……\r\n好啦，那就来做吧～","source_fingerprint":"1bbbee9f32fed235aba6e40d587b720ac7d3fec4c16a1c27612cc036cd02e7a2","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1020","20007"],"target_text":"Ư ư ư, huấn luyện……\r\nThôi được, vậy làm nào～","reviewed":true},
{"entry_index":43,"uid":"zhcn:541065076b37d25fc977681a","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"训练员，我们还是来去钓鱼吧，\r\n钓鱼～","source_fingerprint":"071b28100ee5713fd4fc27de65680ac64c7cbaffbcf18d11a33476529abd1df6","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1020","20008"],"target_text":"Trainer, hay là chúng ta đi câu cá đi,\r\ncâu cá～","reviewed":true},
{"entry_index":44,"uid":"zhcn:e8e998bce5db8286ff610760","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"哎呀——毕竟你的对象是我嘛，\r\n觉得我会认真做训练……\r\n可别对我有这种过高的期待哦——","source_fingerprint":"ebbd56d595d1ac8ace1fa99b5b4aa06323c508200f6b7b320eab51b9e6bafece","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1020","20009"],"target_text":"Ôi chà—— dù sao người cậu phụ trách là mình mà,\r\nnghĩ rằng mình sẽ nghiêm túc huấn luyện……\r\nđừng kỳ vọng cao đến thế nhé——","reviewed":true}
]}
